msgid "Thunder Tiger Toyota Hilux"
msgstr "Thunder Tiger Toyota Hilux"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:10
#: db88f2ae407841ce8be99ed933ac343d
msgid ""
"The Thunder Tiger Toyota Hilux is a relatively inexpensive four wheel "
"drive RC car with a top speed of about 1m/s."
msgstr "Thunder Tiger Toyota Hilux 是一款价格相对低廉的四驱遥控车，最高速度约为 1m/s。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:12
#: 539924f7b17c42d49579667ad56af39d
msgid ""
"One weakness of this frame is the suspension is a bit soft once the frame"
" is loaded up with the required electronics (autopilot, GPS, receiver) "
"which leads to some body role during stops."
msgstr "该车架的一个缺点是，加装所需电子设备（飞控、GPS、接收机）后悬架略显偏软，导致停车时有些车身侧倾。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:15
#: 2edd21c877e948d591ba20b4800fd4fc
msgid "Parts List"
msgstr "零件清单"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-tt-toyotahilux.rst:17
#: 0f92bb0a25e1459c883e6777746e4ce3
msgid ""
"`Thunder Tiger Toyota Hilux frame <https://www.thundertiger.com/products-"
"detail.php?id=74>`__ available from many retailers including `Amazon "
"<https://www.amazon.com/Thunder-Tiger-TOYOTA-HILUX-PICK-"
"UP/dp/B071WJCMKN>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Thunder Tiger Toyota Hilux 车架 <https://www.thundertiger.com/products-"
"detail.php?id=74>`__，可从多家零售商购买，包括 `Amazon <https://www.amazon.com"
"/Thunder-Tiger-TOYOTA-HILUX-PICK-UP/dp/B071WJCMKN>`__"

